  "summary": "NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)-- Voya Financial, Inc. (NYSE: VOYA) will issue a press release announcing its second-quarter 2026 financial results after the market closes on Tuesday, August 4, 2026 and host a call to review the results on Wednesday, August 5, 2026, from 10 a.m. to 11 a.m.",
